{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4b0efc939dc234ff5d1e0e48b1035d48119071bacaf2a38f7ad5179e0b0b844e", "ja": "『Clover』の単独ライブ当日。出番を目前\nに控え、これまでを振り返るアイドル達。\n可奈が劇場に来た日の衝撃的な自己紹介や、\n志保が可奈の指導係になった時の思い出を\n話す。", "zh": "『Clover』单独演唱会当天。即将登台的偶像们回顾着一路走来的经历。\n她们聊起可奈来到剧场那天令人震惊的自我介绍，以及志保成为可奈指导员时的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "466cb70338257e7a014672cf915656f0f1145dfa2d8ec3af1a5320519e1ea42f", "ja": "はじめまして矢吹可奈です！", "zh": "初次见面，我是矢吹可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "e63a3672b1e20fc5bee6e9b7cd4be38946629d6d7d4b964788154fe79ba3721e", "ja": "自己紹介に歌を作ってきたので、\n一曲歌わせてください！！", "zh": "我为自我介绍写了一首歌，\n请让我唱一曲吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "87b037958e1f347b762979b8c3586422a40259806d62274ace061ceb0c065d0e", "ja": "歌！？", "zh": "唱歌！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "87b037958e1f347b762979b8c3586422a40259806d62274ace061ceb0c065d0e", "ja": "歌！？", "zh": "唱歌！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "fbb370efc5394232de49bf285e5238727c44859322e32b0a8f78f5d564c03e93", "ja": "すぅっ……", "zh": "吸气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "a444d998cd64a11c054260cd21afa8906f36c1fe246e539300b317eec62bd916", "ja": "私の名前は矢吹可奈ぁ～♪\n好きなことは～♪　歌う事～♪", "zh": "我的名字是矢吹可奈～♪\n喜欢的事情是～♪唱歌～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "b62281b768ef85ee63ad72fe2e5524f919251cd34dceb2e11aa3944683f42edf", "ja": "苦手なものはお化けですー♪\n……～♪", "zh": "我最怕的东西是鬼——♪\n……～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "b98f3bf5b5d89b388ee5dee1bcc8ed3e065afea460048967eb554b28135f22a7", "ja": "（なんでこんな子が、アイドルになれたの！？）", "zh": "（这样的人，怎么会成为偶像的！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "c4b5ffb7e5a99871044cfb53cc413849d85d2ef1bd6ff864c9b63a8826260e24", "ja": "って、衝撃を受けたから。", "zh": "因为受到了这样的冲击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "296ef6990264dfe945516003934c800cdeef8b26cc47e1e2c4d4e0fa2e4e2399", "ja": "うう、練習より音程とれたと\n思ってたんだけどな～。", "zh": "呜呜，我还以为自己比练习时唱得更准了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "9a5c54bd1768d4392287967885a2ce1bb806bb89724e6b07d873f38bfadd7321", "ja": "そう思えることにも驚いたの。\nまあ、今聞いたら……違ったかもしれないけど。", "zh": "居然会那么觉得，我也很惊讶。\n不过，要是现在再听一遍……或许就不一样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "7d9d59655f3baded44ad7763a14fa56177c5e25539e94eafd016b69796b19424", "ja": "！　じつは上手だった！？", "zh": "！原来其实很擅长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "4b2f5bff3c6a62ef8cc46987ac8d6e9cb2f0b093de4f5789b07218a572bbaf49", "ja": "そういうことじゃないわ。", "zh": "不是那个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "67b7c433e63c150562307eb1deeaf74d6d5aa1da1c759dbf3e6b1de39601500f", "ja": "ガーン……！", "zh": "大受打击……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "1ecb7cd237091e5991ed383937fd6a0d398f851022070396a099383ce4055f9e", "ja": "ふふっ、いいなぁ。可奈さんのはじめましての歌、\nわたしも聞いてみたかったです♪", "zh": "呵呵，真好啊。我也很想听听可奈第一次见面时唱的歌呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "4ad8485d4bcf048117e9b0a697c65aa56ef4ab10655f038bf9460f705742e849", "ja": "面白い歌だったよ～☆　で、あの後すぐだったよね？\nプロデューサーが急にしほりんのところに行って……。", "zh": "是首很有趣的歌哦～☆然后，之后马上就发生了对吧？制作人突然去了志保那里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1017_405bcp", "source_sha256": "e6a5450ab818e5681f829c1d9b8a997e094e29aad6ac5b7eb84abb627e59b6fd", "ja": "可奈の歌はどうだ？　志保。", "zh": "可奈的歌怎么样？志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "1979b94d96ebc5c7ee5b304ab967a856ece6762f0b32b812085c513b51d09cf1", "ja": "アイドルなのにあんな実力で笑っている\nその神経が、私には理解できません。", "zh": "明明是偶像，却凭那种实力还笑得出来  \n我实在无法理解她的神经。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "2b532b12a24753e3fa1d99b88485472acf07b13b9c9d1fe02fa50da933b4ff13", "ja": "私には関係ないことですから\n別にかまいませんけど。", "zh": "因为和我没关系，所以倒也无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1021_405bcp", "source_sha256": "b613dcfcf9b6bce7b89757f7a7f16a442123ce763e893caca878f63b4393bd4e", "ja": "……。可奈！", "zh": "……可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "22cb6321db1bafd145b0b8548de16a64bd5a2d5db09c441f2fb2ed392ef569de", "ja": "！　なんですか、プロデューサーさん？", "zh": "！怎么了，制作人先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1023_405bcp", "source_sha256": "89603a0fd142597b744bba8ec48cfd2aeb707fadace827e3f69538627e96f794", "ja": "今日から可奈の指導係を務める志保だ。", "zh": "从今天起，我就是负责指导可奈的志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "6a5710b76bd009cd99b2f90067f9dc1ad566d1ba8523d0586ef18091232259fc", "ja": "……はい？", "zh": "……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1025_405bcp", "source_sha256": "dfaf057b57c3a211fc184d11697b288887ecbb1afdbefdc3c0ab81237b5d53d9", "ja": "可奈の指導係を務める志保だ。\n当面劇場では2人で行動するように。", "zh": "我是负责指导可奈的志保。暂时在剧场里请以2人一起行动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "1a61464855874c31bcb3ecf0ac46c37c1edbd91c39b841fa4151cd3d1753df7f", "ja": "！　プロデューサーさん！？", "zh": "！制作人先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1027_405bcp", "source_sha256": "c4c3b3f031b4a0f60390c364c66c02c91abfc9183189013f970283cc627c78fa", "ja": "志保、これも仕事だ。", "zh": "志保，这也是工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "68fd994fd3bec15c9f3816d59e9e6e9c7f583f86f45256dfe1b9c010a4c2dea5", "ja": "（一生懸命でカッコイイ志保ちゃんが、\n私の指導係だなんて……！）", "zh": "（认真又帅气的志保，居然要当我的指导老师……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "2a6e6a2e5f3e30246271c2f5008d073153c2dc89cecdcdc71ba564b042b348d4", "ja": "私の名前は、矢吹可奈～♪\n私のことは、可奈って呼んでくださいね～♪", "zh": "我的名字叫矢吹可奈～♪\n请叫我可奈就好啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "7931f51280a0ae7da87c93bfccfbda2aae40dca105252a282ba207922a0fb499", "ja": "よろしく。『矢吹』さん。", "zh": "请多关照。“矢吹”同学。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_01_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3b442802972fe4e299a0c98ad45c58b2d62e5fdc72657e033e489577ff9f54e", "ja": "ひっ！\nよ、よろしくー……♪　志保ちゃん～……♪", "zh": "咿！\n请、请多关照——……♪ 志保～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
